   "sentenceId": 13,
   "he": "וּמְתַקְּנִין אֶת הַמְקוּלְקֶלֶת בַּמּוֹעֵד. מַאי מְקוּלְקֶלֶת? אָמַר רַבִּי אַבָּא: שֶׁאִם הָיְתָה עֲמוּקָּה טֶפַח — מַעֲמִידָהּ עַל שִׁשָּׁה טְפָחִים.",
   "en": "§ It was taught in the mishna that the Rabbis say: «One may repair a damaged» water channel «during» the intermediate days of «a Festival. What is» meant by «a damaged» water channel? «Rabbi Abba said that if it was» now «a handbreadth deep» because it had become filled with sediment, he may dredge it out until «he sets it at» its original depth of «six handbreadths.»"
  }
